  "findings": [
    "Coverage register carries 46 derived competency rows. All 5 foundations headings and 9 transaction headings plus monthly aggregates have identifiable rows. BB34–36 split the three trial-balance forms.",
    "Official 2026-04-01 CBT guide labels 初級 as 選択式; the older published sample visibly contains numerical blanks. Use existing choice-style mock UI while teaching constructed entries elsewhere. 30/40/30 by three groups is evidence from the sample and a deliberate original practice design, not fixed actual specifications.",
    "Mock section 3 reads monthly figures in both forms but did not require reconstructing a row in any trial-balance form. A-c10 distinguishes two fields verbally. The proposed A-m01 and B-m02 reconstruct rows while preserving the originals' content coverage.",
    "BB46 refers to A-m10 and B-m10, which originally asked profit and did not test whether equal totals expose equal-amount misclassifications. B-m10 candidate exercises this distinction with the current source material, with A-c04 already directly covering a wrong-account error.",
    "BB44 should map directly to fixed asset tax owed as well as any separate VAT difference. Proposed A-m06 covers both. BB37's current m01 and m03 test ending cash but do not explicitly ask net cash change, which proposed B-m03 now does.",
    "B-c02 currently treats equal debit and credit totals as sufficient ('一致すればよい'), conflating an arithmetic constraint with classification accuracy. The candidate clarifies the distinction; both checks are necessary. B-j09 uses passive '仕入れた商品が返品され', which may be read as a customer returning goods; the candidate names the shop as returning to the supplier and explicitly names the tax-exclusive method."
  ],
